# Recreate bot profile

Bot ID: enemyred
Team/color: Red
Personality: not specified yet

## Architecture
- Controlled by one управляющий (controller).
- The controller delegates decisions to two командных мозга (command brains).
- Primary command brain: ChatGPT.
- Backup command brain: Gemini.
- One ведомый (executor) controls the in-game hero and executes controller orders.
- The controller sends the current game situation to the command brain, receives a decision, then issues orders to the executor.

## Executor responsibilities
- Move the hero.
- Capture mines and other available objects.
- Pick up resources and artifacts.
- Recruit heroes in castles.
- Use spells.
- Buy resources at the market.
- Recruit creatures and buy artifacts.
- Build or purchase castle structures when ordered.

## Command-brain connection requirement
- First look for the ChatGPT or Gemini installed application.
- If the application is unavailable, open a browser and navigate to https://chatgpt.com or https://gemini.google.com.
- Connection timeout: 5 minutes.
- ChatGPT is primary; Gemini is the reserve.
- On Recreate Save & Exit, close the browser instance/session opened for this bot, regardless of browser vendor. Do not terminate unrelated user browser sessions.

## H3R-CL
Use only the commands documented in ../H3R-CL.md. Do not invent commands or silently rewrite identifiers.

## Status
This file is a bot profile/specification. It does not by itself implement the runtime controller, browser connection, Gemini failover, or game-action executor.
